  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCR 2009-2011</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CCR 2009-2011</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCR, based in Cape Town, South Africa plans to utilise the core support for its Africa Programme, which includes two inter-related projects: the Conflict Intervention and Peacebuilding Support and the Policy Development and Research projects. The support to CCR was evaluated during 2008. Since the conclusions of the evaluation on the whole have been positive, Sida has decided to continue financing.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CCR, baserat i Kapstaden i Sydafrika, planerar att anv&#xe4;nda sitt organisationsst&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r sitt Afrikaprogram, som innefattar tv&#xe5; relaterade projekt: Konfliktintervention och St&#xf6;d till Fredsbyggande samt Policyutveckling och Forskning. St&#xf6;det till CCR utv&#xe4;rderades under 2008. Eftersom slutsatserna fr&#xe5;n utv&#xe4;rderingen i allm&#xe4;nhet var positiva har Sida beslutat att forts&#xe4;tta finansieringen.</narrative>
  </description>
